
This directory contains annotated data in French (folder data) and the calculation of some units (folder statistics) obtained using the script available in the src folder.

```
.
├── data
│   ├── Manuel_Annotation_propp.md
│   ├── connlu
│   │   ├── *.conllu
│   ├── entities
│   │   ├── *.entities
│   │   ├── *.tokens
│   │   ├── *.txt
│   └── sacr
│       ├── *.sacr
│
├── src
│   └── countEntities.py
└── statistics
    ├── COUNT_coref.csv
    ├── md_chaine.md
    ├── md_corpus.md
    ├── md_entities.md
    ├── md_mentions.md
    └── res_nbTokens.pkl

```

